  "dct_description_sm": [
    "A network of temperature loggers was deployed in the West River channel to record overwinter temperature under different snow accumulation conditions.  We hypothesize that deep snow in channels will reduce winter heat loss and will extend the period of biogeochemical activity.  Data collected 2012-2013, 2015-2019."
